  ('VSME-031', 'vsme', 'environmental', 'basic', 'B3', 'Энергия и выбросы парниковых газов / Energy and greenhouse gas emissions', 'Energy and greenhouse gas emissions', '30(b)', 'mandatory', 'Scope 2 location-based', 'Scope 2 location-based', 'Выбросы purchased electricity, heat, steam, cooling', 'tCO2e', 'Всегда', 'decimal', NULL, 'Guidance paras. 90–109: calculate purchased electricity, heat, steam and cooling using the location-based method; retain consumption, geography, reporting year and grid factor. Market-based Scope 2 may be shown separately where reliable contractual information exists.', 31, true),
  ('VSME-032', 'vsme', 'environmental', 'basic', 'B3', 'Энергия и выбросы парниковых газов / Energy and greenhouse gas emissions', 'Energy and greenhouse gas emissions', '31', 'mandatory', 'GHG intensity', 'GHG intensity', 'Gross Scope 1 + Scope 2 LB, делённые на turnover EUR', 'tCO2e/EUR', 'Всегда', 'decimal', NULL, 'Guidance paras. 90–103: divide gross Scope 1 plus location-based Scope 2 emissions by turnover in euro for the same reporting period; do not subtract offsets or removals.', 32, true),
  ('VSME-033', 'vsme', 'environmental', 'basic', 'B4', 'Загрязнение воздуха, воды и почвы / Pollution of air, water and soil', 'Pollution of air, water and soil', '32', 'conditional', 'Выбросы загрязнителей Воздух', 'Pollutants emitted to air', 'Наименование и количество каждого загрязнителя: воздух', NULL, 'Если уже требуется законом/нац. нормами или добровольно по EMS', 'multi_reference', NULL, 'Guidance paras. 110–133: first confirm that pollution reporting is legally required or performed under an environmental management system. For pollutants emitted to air, record each pollutant separately with medium, quantity, unit, facility, method and reporting period; a public source may be cross-referenced.', 33, true),
  ('VSME-034', 'vsme', 'environmental', 'basic', 'B4', 'Загрязнение воздуха, воды и почвы / Pollution of air, water and soil', 'Pollution of air, water and soil', '32', 'conditional', 'Выбросы загрязнителей Вода', 'Pollutants emitted to water', 'Наименование и количество каждого загрязнителя: вода', NULL, 'Если уже требуется законом/нац. нормами или добровольно по EMS', 'multi_reference', NULL, 'Guidance paras. 110–133: first confirm that pollution reporting is legally required or performed under an environmental management system. For pollutants emitted to water, record each pollutant separately with medium, quantity, unit, facility, method and reporting period; a public source may be cross-referenced.', 34, true),
