  ('VSME-036', 'vsme', 'environmental', 'basic', 'B4', 'Загрязнение воздуха, воды и почвы / Pollution of air, water and soil', 'Pollution of air, water and soil', '32', 'conditional', 'Публичная ссылка на сведения о загрязнении', 'Public link to reported pollutant information', 'URL документа, если сведения публичны', NULL, 'Если используется ссылка вместо повторного раскрытия', 'string', NULL, 'Guidance paras. 110–133: first confirm that pollution reporting is legally required or performed under an environmental management system. For public link to reported pollutant information, record each pollutant separately with medium, quantity, unit, facility, method and reporting period; a public source may be cross-referenced.', 36, true),
